# --- secrets and operator state: never commit (a key that reached the history must be treated as compromised) ---
credentials*.json*
*.bak
*.bak-*
**/ca.key
**/gnupg/
**/npn-ca/
**/oneq-ca/
**/npn-signing/
**/oneq-signing/
**/npn-admin-2fa/
**/oneq-admin-2fa/
**/*enrol*
**/*.pass
**/proxy.key
**/.env
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
**/key.properties
id_ed25519*
id_rsa*
